  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for Country Partnership for Pakistan (2025-2030)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The national policy document Pakistan Vision 2025 emphasizes the need to industrialize the country to achieve sustained, inclusive, and sustainable economic growth. In line with this vision, the National Industrial Policy is currently under formulation and expected to be launched soon. The Program for Country Partnership (PCP) is anticipated to support the government in the formulation and modification of this policy, ensuring it aligns with international best practices and promotes industrial competitiveness, sustainability, and innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
